    <briefdescription>
<para>A structured representation of a legal obligation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures the actor, the required action, and the condition under which the obligation applies.</para>
<para>Example: &quot;Wer Anlagen betreiben will, bedarf einer Genehmigung.&quot; actor = &quot;Betreiber&quot; action = &quot;Genehmigung einholen&quot; condition = &quot;Betrieb einer Anlage&quot; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
